<title>USA: Lazard combines U.S/UK asset management operations.</title>
<headline>Lazard combines U.S/UK asset management operations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lazard Houses has combined their British and American asset management operations into a single global entity called Lazard Asset Management, Michel David -Weill, chairman of Lazard Freres &amp; Co LLC, said.</p>
<p>The new company's formation is subject to regulatory approvals, he said.</p>
